## Description

Lilian Weng shared today that she is leaving Thinking Machines Lab to focus on her health.  I went back to this 2019 talk at OpenAI. In front of 100+ women in tech, she made a difficult frontier problem, teaching a robotic hand dexterous manipulation through reinforcement https://t.co/5H7jwtQkk7

